  "description": {
    "en": "Toroline Truffle X is an ultra-soft, highly elastic tennis string built from a new non-polyester polymer and positioned as a modern alternative to traditional multifilaments. With a manufacturer-reported static stiffness of just 0.20 kg/mm, it is substantially softer than natural gut, leading multifilaments and performance co-polyesters in the supplied comparison. Truffle X delivers extreme pocketing, plush comfort and explosive pop while aiming to maintain feel and playability longer than conventional multifilament constructions. It is designed primarily as a hybrid cross, with Toroline specifically recommending pairing it with a slick co-poly main such as O-TORO.",

    "zh": "Toroline Truffle X 是一款采用全新非聚酯现代聚合物制造的超柔软、高弹性球线，定位为传统 Multifilament 多芯线的现代替代方案。Toroline 提供的数据中，它的静态刚性仅为 0.20 kg/mm，明显低于天然肠线、多款主流多芯线以及高性能聚酯线。Truffle X 的核心优势是极高弹性、强烈 Pocketing、柔软 Plush 手感和爆发性 Pop，同时目标是在保持舒适性的情况下获得比传统多芯线更持久的可打性。官方主要推荐将其作为 Hybrid 横线，尤其与 O-TORO 等低摩擦共聚酯主线搭配。"
  },

